{
  "dashboard": {
    "id": null,
    "uid": "perfumes-ep3",
    "title": "Perfumes API EP3 - Operacion y CI CD",
    "tags": ["ep3", "perfumes-api", "observability"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 1,
    "refresh": "30s",
    "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
    "templating": {
      "list": [
        {
          "name": "datasource",
          "type": "datasource",
          "query": "prometheus",
          "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "Prometheus" },
          "label": "Fuente de metricas"
        }
      ]
    },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "Solicitudes por segundo",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "datasource": "$datasource",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_service_name=\"perfumes-api\"}[1m]))",
            "legendFormat": "rps"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "Errores HTTP 5xx",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "datasource": "$datasource",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum(rate(istio_requests_total{reporter=\"destination\",destination_service_name=\"perfumes-api\",response_code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
            "legendFormat": "errores 5xx por segundo"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" }, "overrides": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "title": "CPU de los pods de la API",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "datasource": "$datasource",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum(rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"perfumes\",pod=~\"perfumes-api-.*\",container=\"api\"}[5m]))",
            "legendFormat": "cores usados"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cores" }, "overrides": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "title": "Memoria de los pods de la API",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "datasource": "$datasource",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "expr": "sum(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"perfumes\",pod=~\"perfumes-api-.*\",container=\"api\"})",
            "legendFormat": "memoria"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] }
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "title": "Trazabilidad CI CD",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "## Metricas de entrega\n\n- **Tiempo de despliegue** y **cobertura de pruebas** se publican en el Step Summary de cada run de GitHub Actions.\n- Esta vista concentra las metricas operacionales: solicitudes, errores, CPU y memoria.\n- Usa el SHA del run y el tag inmutable de la imagen para correlacionar una degradacion con el despliegue que la introdujo."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "folderId": 0,
  "overwrite": true
}
